d‑regime schedule (Finance Act) – tax on slabs ₹180,000 (trace) |\n| Cess | Health & Education Cess @ 4 % (trace) | Same rate @ 4 % (trace) |\n\n---\n\n### Assumptions made\n\n1. **Only the deductions you listed** (standard deduction, 80C, 80CCD (1B), 80D) exist; no other exemptions (e.g., HRA, home‑loan interest) are being claimed.  \n2. **No surcharge** applies because the taxable income is below the surcharge threshold for FY 2026‑27 (as reflected in both traces).  \n3. **No rebate under section 87A** is available – the trace shows a rebate of ₹0 for both regimes, and the income level exceeds the rebate ceiling.  \n4. The figures supplied by the tool are accurate and correspond to the FY 2026‑27 assessment year (AY 2027‑28).\n\n---\n\n### What could change",
